+# Pending changes after 0.9.5 — not compiled
+
+- The places list shows a plain title for unvisited places and a check mark for visited places. Map markers retain ? / ✓.
+- All catalog places get a 75-metre transparent preview with a soft outer edge (up to 10 metres). The preview is only part of the fog bitmap and never changes visits, recorded walks, explored territory, or discovery radius.
+- Preview centers refresh on initial load, file import, website sync, clear-all, backup restore, and resume. Deleted places lose their preview; genuinely walked areas remain.
+- Preview circles share the existing cached mask and its pan/zoom/rotation transform; points outside the cache are skipped. No fixed screen-pixel minimum is used for these circles.
+
+Compilation and main-branch updates require the user's explicit confirmation. Do not dispatch a workflow or move this draft to main yet.
+
+Unresolved discussion: visible sea/coastline, grouping crowded map markers, whether both map styles are useful, and offline maps. These are not implemented in this draft.
+
+Validation: source/diff review only. Not compiled or tested on Android.
